cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you reference this analysis, please cite it as below.
title: "Bun after the Rust rewrite: bug reports, releases, and downloads"
authors:
  - family-names: Smyshliaev
    given-names: Aleksandr
  - family-names: Gulya
    given-names: Ilya
version: "2026.10.30"
date-released: 2026-10-30
url: "https://github.com/IlyaGulya/bun-rust-rewrite-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Updated fork of Aleksandr Smyshliaev's study of Bun's May 2026 rewrite.
  It separates before-merge, Rust-canary, and after-stable report dates.
  A version-family map groups stated versions into Zig, Rust, and unclear
  lines. Three-period tables compare counts, crashes, leaks, and npm
  request rates. Reports run through 30 October; npm data through
  28 October. The study does not estimate a causal Rust effect or
  defects per active user.
keywords:
  - rust
  - zig
  - bun
  - ai-assisted-development
  - empirical-software-engineering
